{"sectionId":"organic-polymers/polymers","items":[{"id":"organic-polymers--polymers-k001","sectionId":"organic-polymers/polymers","unitId":"organic-polymers","subject":"chemistry","text":"연쇄성장 중합은 개시 후 활성 사슬 말단에 단량체가 첨가되는 방식이며 radical 중합 등이 대표적이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic-polymers--polymers-k002","sectionId":"organic-polymers/polymers","unitId":"organic-polymers","subject":"chemistry","text":"단계성장 중합은 서로 반응 가능한 작용기를 가진 분자들이 단계적으로 결합한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic-polymers--polymers-k003","sectionId":"organic-polymers/polymers","unitId":"organic-polymers","subject":"chemistry","text":"축합 중합은 작은 분자를 방출하는 경우가 많지만 단계성장과 축합은 완전히 같은 분류가 아니다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic-polymers--polymers-k004","sectionId":"organic-polymers/polymers","unitId":"organic-polymers","subject":"chemistry","text":"polyethylene, polystyrene, polyester, polyamide 등은 반복단위와 결합 특성을 구별한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic-polymers--polymers-k005","sectionId":"organic-polymers/polymers","unitId":"organic-polymers","subject":"chemistry","text":"유기 실험에서 추출은 분배와 산염기 평형, 재결정은 용해도, TLC는 고정상과 이동상에 대한 상호작용 차이를 이용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic-polymers--polymers-k006","sectionId":"organic-polymers/polymers","unitId":"organic-polymers","subject":"chemistry","text":"정상상 silica TLC에서는 이동상과 비교한 극성 상호작용에 의해 Rf가 달라지며 같은 조건에서 비교해야 한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic-polymers--polymers-k007","sectionId":"organic-polymers/polymers","unitId":"organic-polymers","subject":"chemistry","text":"Rf=용질 이동거리/용매전선 이동거리이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic-polymers--polymers-k008","sectionId":"organic-polymers/polymers","unitId":"organic-polymers","subject":"chemistry","text":"실험 수득량은 손실과 순도 영향을 함께 고려한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic-polymers--polymers-k009","sectionId":"organic-polymers/polymers","unitId":"organic-polymers","subject":"chemistry","text":"이 단원은 현재 MDEET의 직접 출제 범위로 단정하지 않고 구 시험 및 보충 지식으로 관리한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic-polymers--polymers-k010","sectionId":"organic-polymers/polymers","unitId":"organic-polymers","subject":"chemistry","text":"연쇄성장과 단계성장 중합을 구별한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic-polymers--polymers-k011","sectionId":"organic-polymers/polymers","unitId":"organic-polymers","subject":"chemistry","text":"TLC Rf는 0~1 범위의 상대값이다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic-polymers--polymers-k012","sectionId":"organic-polymers/polymers","unitId":"organic-polymers","subject":"chemistry","text":"재결정은 순도 개선 과정에서 일부 수득량 손실이 발생한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic-polymers--polymers-k013","sectionId":"organic-polymers/polymers","unitId":"organic-polymers","subject":"chemistry","text":"Amide 결합이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]}]}